"Replace <WAN_SERVER> with the router WAN address before running the command."
msgstr "运行命令前请将 <WAN_SERVER> 替换为路由器 WAN 地址。"

msgid "Rill decisions are throttled; try again shortly"
msgstr "Rill 决策已限流，请稍后重试"

msgid ""
"Rill ranks actions that passed the Core engine review; the Core engine "
"keeps the final authority to execute them. Confidence and scores are shown "
"as percentages (0–1 maps to 0–100%)."
msgstr ""
"Rill 对通过核心引擎审核的操作排序；最终执行权由核心引擎掌握。置信度和评分按"
"百分比显示（0–1 对应 0–100%）。"

msgid ""
"Rill recommendation was not applied: %s. Review the safety state and try "
"again."
msgstr "Rill 建议未应用：%s。请检查安全状态后重试。"

